\"\n    description: \"完整控制实验：在 4 个模型上用 QLoRA SFT 注入 0%/5%/10%/15%/25%/50% benchmark items，测量 Δlz* 全谱。建立 ground-truth contamination → Δlz* 映射。\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 80\n    deps: [exp-ctrl-contam-pilot]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"模型: Qwen3.5-9B + Gemma-4-31B + Llama-3.1-8B + Mistral-7B-v0.3。Benchmark: MMLU + GSM8K + HellaSwag。4 模型 × 6 levels × 3 benchmarks。\"\n\n  - id: exp-empirical-null\n    registry_id: exp-empirical-null\n    claim: 1\n    description: \"Bootstrap empirical null 分析：量化 lz* 在真实 LLM 数据上的 systematic bias（null mean ≠ 0, null std ≠ 1），为 Calibration Gap Analysis 提供定量证据。包含 Q-Q plots、KS tests、bias 量化表、unflagged cells 深度分析。\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-two-sided]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"CPU only. 复用 exp-two-sided v2 的 bootstrap 逻辑，但保存完整中间分布。~2h 开发+运行。\"\n\n  - id: exp-power-theory\n    registry_id: exp-power-theory\n    claim: 2\n    description: \"推导 power 与 n_items 的解析关系（基于 Snijders 2001 lz* 方差公式）。验证理论曲线与 Phase A 模拟结果的拟合度。将 inverted-U 从经验观察升级为理论命题。\"\n    priority: P1\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-extended-sim]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"纯理论推导 + 数值验证。CPU only.\"\n\n  # === P1: Important (robustness + differentiation) ===\n\n  - id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\n    registry_id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\n    claim: 3\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 数据可用性调研：确认 HuggingFace open-llm-leaderboard-old/results 是否包含 per-item binary response logs（不仅是 aggregate scores）。如果可用，评估数据量（多少模型有 per-item data）、格式、覆盖的 benchmarks。如果不可用，估算自己跑推理的 GPU 预算增量。\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: []\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"纯调研，CPU only。结果直接决定 exp-leaderboard-audit 的可行性和 GPU 预算。\"\n\n  - id: exp-leaderboard-audit\n    claim: 3\n    description: \"Open LLM Leaderboard v1 大规模扫描：对所有可用模型计算 person-fit。绘制 per-benchmark 污染率随时间趋势。\"\n    priority: ABANDONED\n    gpu_budget_hours: 20\n    deps: [exp-two-sided, exp-leaderboard-data-recon]\n    status: abandoned\n    notes: \"D011: v1-irt-refit a_r=0.111 + item alignment 54.56% → 13K audit 不可行。数据可用性写入 Discussion/Future Work。\"\n\n  - id: exp-natural-experiment\n    claim: 3\n    description: \"v1 leaderboard base→chat model pairs 自然实验：计算 Δlz* = lz*(chat) - lz*(base) 作为 SFT 效应代理。\"\n    priority: P2-optional\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot]\n    status: deprioritized\n    notes: \"D013: a_r=0.111 导致 lz*≈accuracy-like, 仅 4-5 pairs 无统计检验能力。Reviewer 终审建议降级。\"\n\n  - id: exp-v1-irt-refit-expanded\n    claim: 3\n    description: \"扩大 v1 IRT 重拟合样本量至 N≥500，验证 pilot N=63 的 a_r=0.111 是否因样本量不足。最终关闭 Path D。\"\n    priority: P0\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot]\n    status: assigned\n    notes: \"CPU only. Reviewer 要求 N≥500 才能最终结论 Path D。阈值：a_r>0.4=可行, a_r<0.2=dead。\"\n\n  - id: exp-4pl-ablation\n    claim: 1\n    description: \"4PL vs 3PL(d=1) ablation：比较两种参数化下的检测灵敏度差异。量化 feasibility parameter d 对 false alarm 和 detection power 的影响。\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-extended-sim]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"CPU only. 用已有 PSN-IRT 参数，固定 d=1 重新计算。\"\n\n  - id: exp-baseline-comparison\n    claim: 1\n    description: \"与现有方法对比（≥5 baselines）：在控制实验的 ground-truth contaminated models 上，比较 IRT-FIT vs baselines 的 AUROC/Type-I error。Baselines: (1) ConStat (re-test), (2) Min-K%++ (token probs), (3) accuracy z-score (已完成, CPU), (4) PPL-based detection (log-prob family 代表, 预期 RL-robust 测试中失败), (5) random baseline。量化 minimal-information 的代价（power 损失）。报告 bootstrap CIs（同行 6/8 不报告方差，这是我们的差异化优势）。\"\n    priority: P0-end\n    gpu_budget_hours: 30\n    deps: [exp-ctrl-contam]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"蒸馏显示同行 baseline 中位数 ~5 个。accuracy z-score 已完成(CPU)。ConStat 需 re-test, Min-K%++ 需 token probs, PPL 需 log-probs。exp-ctrl-contam 完成后立即执行。\"\n\n  - id: exp-multiscale-lzm\n    claim: \"1,3\"\n    description: \"实现 multiscale lzm 统计量（Hong, Lin & Cheng, 2021）——跨 benchmark 聚合的标准化 lz* 总分，提供整体污染指标。在 PSN-IRT 12 模型 + 控制实验模型上验证。\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-two-sided]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"CPU only. 需要实现 lzm 公式。\"\n\n  # === P2: Nice-to-have (expanded scope) ===\n\n  - id: exp-post-rl\n    claim: 1\n    description: \"Post-RL 假设检验：在 Qwen3.5-9B 上先 SFT 污染再 GRPO 训练，测试 person-fit 是否在 RL 后仍保持检测力。回应 Wang et al. (2025) 的 MIA 失效问题。\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 40\n    deps: [exp-ctrl-contam]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"GRPO 训练需要 reward model 或 rule-based reward。可能需要 2× RTX 5090。\"\n\n  - id: exp-extra-benchmarks\n    claim: \"2,3\"\n    description: \"扩展 benchmark：BBH (6,511 items) 和 MATH (5,000 items) 填充 1K-10K items 的 power gap。需要获取 4PL 参数（PSN-IRT 可能已有）。\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 10\n    deps: [exp-extended-sim]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"取决于 PSN-IRT 是否包含这些 benchmark 的参数。如果没有，需要自己校准 4PL（GPU + 大量推理）。\"\n\n  - id: exp-domain-analysis\n    claim: 3\n    description: \"MMLU domain-level 分析：按 subject category 分别计算 person-fit，识别 Gemini-1.5 的 MMLU 污染是全面的还是集中在特定 domain。\"\n    priority: P2\n    gpu_budget_hours: 0\n    deps: [exp-two-sided]\n    status: planned\n    notes: \"CPU only. 需要 MMLU item-to-domain 映射。\"\n\n# === GPU Budget Summary (post-D011/D013) ===\n# P0: ~92 GPU-hrs (ctrl-contam-pilot 12 + ctrl-contam 80)\n# P0-end: ~30 GPU-hrs (baseline-comparison, 依赖 ctrl-contam)\n# P2: ~50 GPU-hrs (post-rl 40 + extra-benchmarks 10) — DDL 压力下不现实\n# ABANDONED: exp-leaderboard-audit (D011)\n# Total active: ~122 GPU-hrs\n# Available: 4× RTX 5090 32GB (bjb2-36806, SSH 不通)\n# 已用: 0 GPU-hrs\n","numLines":165,"startLine":1,"totalLines":165}}}
